config BR2_PACKAGE_HARDENED_SG2002_CODEC_FIRMWARE
	bool "SG2002 codec firmware (vendor port input)"
	depends on BR2_riscv
	help
	  Install the immutable vendor codec firmware input under
	  /usr/share/fw_vcodec. This does not provide the CVI MMF/VENC userspace
	  stack and must not be treated as a functional video implementation.

	  The archive has no reviewed license declaration. It is restricted to
	  port-lab use until legal redistribution approval is recorded.
